    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001101",
        "SRC-001110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "KTVU (Apr. 3, 2019): the project replaces 59 apartments built in the 1970s with 55 townhomes the city estimated would sell for about $1.5 million each; council vote 6-1. ABC7 names the developer as Morgan Hill-based Dividend Homes and reports the move-out date was extended through September 2019.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003443",
        "SRC-003442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State APR Table A2 lists project \"2310 Rock St\" on original APN 147-12-065 with certificates of occupancy issued from 2022-01-14 to 2022-10-05 for units on Rock St, Toledo Ter and Independence Ave.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County parcel book page 147-41 holds 55 parcels (147-41-019 to -073) with situs addresses on Independence Ave, Toledo Ter and Rock St that match the unit addresses in the state report.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Grosvenor's page for Maravilla describes a 55-unit, three-story row townhome community in Mountain View by Dividend Homes, completed with final home closing in 2022, and says Grosvenor committed $17.5m to Dividend Homes for it. The page gives no street address.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003444"
      ]
    }
